      "rendered_text": "<div class='banner'><strong>RoB spans span-checked (cross-family): 97% agreement</strong> (32 of 33 scoreable), from a seeded sample of 45 model/registry-derived domain ratings independently checked by a different model family (Fable) against each trial abstract; 12 were unscoreable (no claim, or a conservative not-stated rating). This check itself found and fixed a real error &mdash; one trial (EMPHASIS-HF) was mislabelled NON_RANDOMIZED by the registry, contradicted by its abstract; the RoB block was also visibly broken until a human review caught it. The number is here because a RoB block a reader cannot trust is worthless (<code>docs/rob_spancheck.json</code>).</div>",
